prompt:
This Python code sometimes loops forever. Find the bug and fix it:

def search(items, x):
    lo, hi = 0, len(items) - 1
    while lo < hi:
        mid = (lo + hi) // 2
        if items[mid] < x:
            lo = mid
        else:
            hi = mid
    return lo if items and items[lo] == x else -1
